  "blocks": [
    {
      "kind": "callout",
      "body": [
        {
          "spans": [
            {
              "text": "In Pesukei D'Zimrah we thanked Hashem for all He does for the universe and for us specifically, and we focused on the truth that Hashem is the only Source for everything. In the section after Barchu—the Shema—we will accept and affirm our responsibility to use all He has given us toward the mission He put us here for! Before we do that, we \"break\" with Kaddish and Barchu, which sum up that mission! And what is that mission? That the entire world should recognize that Hashem is the Source of all and that all will \"bless His Name,\" i.e., will realize that all He does (in general, and for each individual) and all that He commands is perfect and for the ultimate best."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
